        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Jeremy McGrath Supercross 2000 is a title based on the sport of motocross racing, where players can compete indoors, outdoors, in tournaments or in a series of freestyle challenges. The game is played from a perspective behind the bike as you strive to place first while negotiating the various hills and turns that characterize the dirt-filled tracks.\n\nA total of four game modes are available to aspiring riders: Race, Series Mode, Time Trial and Freestyle. Race is a contest to see who is the fastest driver on your choice of tracks; after the race is over, you can choose another track and rider or move on to another mode. Series Mode is the heart of the game, where you'll be able to embark on an Indoor SuperCross, Outdoor Nationals, Combined event or your own Custom series.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Jeremy McGrath Supercross 2000 es un título basado en el motocross, en el que los jugadores pueden competir en interiores, en exteriores, en torneos o en una serie de desafíos de freestyle. La partida se muestra desde una perspectiva detrás de la moto mientras intentas quedar primero sorteando las colinas y curvas que caracterizan los circuitos de tierra.\n\nHay cuatro modos de juego disponibles para los aspirantes a pilotos: Race, Series Mode, Time Trial y Freestyle. Race es una competición para ver quién es el piloto más rápido en el circuito que elijas; al terminar la carrera, puedes elegir otro circuito y piloto o pasar a otro modo. Series Mode es el corazón del juego, donde podrás embarcarte en un Indoor SuperCross, en los Outdoor Nationals, en un evento combinado o en tu propia serie personalizada.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2000",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
